#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Quick Start Guide to Adding an Entry to the application launcher"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this example, we will add &firefox; to the <guisubmenu>Internet</"
"guisubmenu> submenu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most applications can be added with &kappfinder;, &firefox; can usually be "
"added that way, but was used for lack of a better example."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start off, we need to open &kmenuedit;, so &RMB; on the application "
"launcher menu, click <guimenuitem>Menu Editor</guimenuitem> to start "
"&kmenuedit;. After &kmenuedit; has started, select <guisubmenu>Internet</"
"guisubmenu> as shown in picture below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Select <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu></screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Select <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu></phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have selected <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu>, click on "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New Item...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, opening the <guilabel>New Item</guilabel> dialog, as shown "
"below. Type the name of the program you want to add, in this case, type "
"<userinput>firefox</userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>New Item</guilabel> dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>New Item</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press return, and you should see something like the picture below in the "
"main window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Item"
msgstr "Element novèl"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "The new item created."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now lets fill in the <guilabel>Description:</guilabel>, in this case type "
"<userinput>Web Browser</userinput>. <note><para>The description and name "
"will be displayed on the application launcher as <quote>Web Browser (Firefox)"
"</quote>.</para></note> We will need to fill in the executable name in the "
"<guilabel>Command:</guilabel> field, in this instance we will type "
"<userinput><command>firefox</command></userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Following the command, you can have several place holders which will be "
"replaced with actual values when the program is run:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "%f - a single file name"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"%F - a list of files; use for applications that can open several local files "
"at once"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "%u - a single &URL;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "%U - a list of &URL;s"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "%d - the folder of a file to open"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "%D - a list of folders"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "%i - the icon"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "%m - the mini icon"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "%c - the caption"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example: if you want to firefox to start your web browsing at www.kde."
"org - instead of <command>firefox</command> you would type <command>firefox %"
"u www.kde.org</command>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We would like to have a more creative icon, so we will click the generic "
"icon sitting beside <guilabel>Name:</guilabel>. It will bring the "
"<guilabel>Select Icon</guilabel> dialog which will let us choose the new "
"icon, as shown below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Select Icon</guilabel> dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Select Icon</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We choose the firefox icon from the list, and press return. Your finished "
"screen should probably look something like the screenshot below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Done screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is what the completed menu item should looks like."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, wait for the <guilabel>Updating System Configuration</guilabel> "
"dialog to get finished, you should find &firefox; in the application "
"launcher <guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> submenu!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kmenuedit;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left application panel shows the application launcher structure. When "
"you browse items in the left panel, the right panel shows detailed "
"information for the highlighted menu item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "General tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Nom :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the name of your program as it appears in the application launcher "
"menu. It can be different from the real executable name. For instance the "
"name of <command>mc</command> executable is \"<application>Midnight "
"Commander</application>\"."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Descripcion :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The description will be displayed together with the name in the application "
"launcher. This is entirely optional."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment:"
msgstr "Comentari :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Describe the program in greater detail in this field. This is entirely "
"optional."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command:"
msgstr "Comanda :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the name of the executable program. Make sure that you have "
"permission to run the program."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable launch feedback"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, this will display feedback when an application is "
"started."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Place in system tray"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, the application's icon will show up in the panel system tray. "
"You will then be able to hide or show the application by clicking on the "
"system tray icon. Clicking on it using the &RMB; will allow also you to "
"undock, or quit the application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only show in &kde;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, the application entry will only be visible in the &kde; "
"application launcher and not in other desktops environments."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Work path:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the work path of the program. This will be the current path when the "
"program launches. It does not need to be the same as the executable location."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run in terminal"
msgstr "Exécuter dans un terminal"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must check this if your program requires terminal emulator in order to "
"run. This mainly applies to <link linkend=\"gloss-console-application"
"\">console applications</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Terminal options:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Put all terminal options in this field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run as a different user"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to run this program as a different user (not you), check this "
"checkbox, and provide the username in the <guilabel>Username:</guilabel> "
"field."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can assign a special keyboard shortcut to launch your program."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>None</guibutton> button to the right of the "
"<guilabel>Current shortcut key:</guilabel> checkbox."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A dialog box will pop up, allowing you to assign a <guilabel>Primary "
"shortcut:</guilabel> by pressing the key combination on your keyboard that "
"you want to be assigned to your program. It might be useful to assign a "
"second keybinding to the same item by checking the <guilabel>Alternate "
"shortcut:</guilabel> button, for example, if you often switch keyboard maps, "
"and some shortcuts are not as convenient to type at all times."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guiicon>x</guiicon> to clear the shortcut, if you made a mistake. "
"Check the <guilabel>Multi-key mode</guilabel> box if you want to assign a "
"shortcut that uses more than one key."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "The dialog will close when you have selected a keybinding."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Item...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adds new menu item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
